  "description": "Many people dream of being reborn as a princess in another world. And Ha-Ri, an ordinary woman, finds herself in that exact situation… or so she thought. Instead of flowy hair and the beautiful face of a princess, she has stubby limbs and shiny black toe beans. Yup, she’s been reincarnated in a palace in another world as a dog. And a talking one, at that! Will she be able to survive as the pet of the emperor rumored to be a ruthless tyrant? Will she ever be able to turn into a human? Find out in this humorous story about a little talking puppy living in a fantasy world!\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
